      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I obtain a reliable moving quote from packers and movers in Khardah?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Request a free, online estimate by sharing your pickup address, destination, inventory list, and preferred moving date. Our system cross‑checks vehicle availability, distance, and required packing materials, then generates a transparent, itemised quote within minutes, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 100% insurance coverage include for my household goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The insurance covers the full declared value of every item you entrust to us, from furniture to electronics. It complies with IRDAI regulations, protects against loss, theft, or damage during transit, and offers a swift claim process with documentation support.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is the IBA approval important when choosing packers and movers in Khardah?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval means the mover adheres to the Indian Banks Association’s code of conduct, guaranteeing ethical practices, verified financial stability, and standardized service quality. This accreditation reassures banks and corporate clients that reimbursements and corporate relocations will be processed smoothly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Khardah‑to‑hub journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You can monitor progress, estimated arrival, and any route deviations in real time, receiving instant alerts via SMS or email.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the key documents required for an interstate move from Khardah?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, GSTIN or PAN for corporate moves, a signed packing list, e‑Way bill for goods exceeding ₹50,000, and insurance declaration. Our team prepares the paperwork, ensuring compliance with both state and central transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect delicate items like glassware?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with high‑density bubble wrap, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets, a foam edge protector, a weather‑proof stretch film, and finally a custom wooden crate. Each layer absorbs shocks, prevents moisture ingress, and distributes weight evenly, guaranteeing safe delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a discount for booking both household shifting and vehicle transport together?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Clients who combine home relocation with two‑wheel or four‑wheel vehicle transport receive a bundled rate discount of up to 12%. The combined booking optimises truck space, reduces handling time, and lowers overall logistics costs.</p>
      </div>
